#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:7
#: 11491624d42c4354ba571399848f7631
msgid "Roll, Pitch and Yaw Controller Tuning"
msgstr "横滚、俯仰和偏航控制器调参"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:9
#: ed73452b23c64468a32a6084d9e61d95
msgid ""
"These instructions will teach you how to tune the roll, pitch and yaw "
"response of your aircraft. This is the first tuning you should do with a new"
" aircraft, as everything else relies on getting this right."
msgstr "这些说明将教您如何调参飞机的横滚、俯仰和偏航响应。这是新飞机应首先进行的调参，因为其他所有调参都依赖于此步骤的正确完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:15
#: e2e186abd6ab4556a202e7914cb0b7ae
msgid ""
"We **strongly** recommend that :ref:`you use AUTOTUNE to perform "
"roll/pitch/yaw tuning <automatic-tuning-with-autotune>`. The instructions in"
" this article should be used if you are unable to fly."
msgstr ""
"我们 **强烈** 建议 :ref:`使用 AUTOTUNE 进行横滚/俯仰/偏航调参 <automatic-tuning-with-"
"autotune>`。本文中的说明适用于无法飞行时的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:21
#: c2bce1a46f884a5985780faa62001408
msgid ""
"The default values for the roll and pitch controllers in Plane are quite "
"deliberately too small for most aircraft. This is because small values will "
"cause ArduPilot to not navigate well and be sluggish, but are less likely to"
" cause the aircraft to crash. The pitch defaults also have a large 'I' gain,"
" to try to compensate for poor initial CG location. Once trimmed via "
":ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>`, this value should be set to 1/5th "
"of the 'P' gain and full tuning done, as instructed below."
msgstr ""
"Plane 中横滚和俯仰控制器的默认值有意设置得对大多数飞机来说偏小。这是因为较小的值会导致 ArduPilot "
"导航不佳且响应迟缓，但不太可能导致飞机坠毁。俯仰默认值还有较大的「I」增益，以尝试补偿初始重心位置不理想的情况。通过 "
":ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>` 微调后，应将此值设为「P」增益的 1/5，然后按下文说明进行完整调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:29
#: 046f11b30e614af9b0de2659989bbaa6
msgid "Preconditions"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:31
#: 0dd75c2333e740db842fc9fce97ce04a
msgid "The following instruction assume that:"
msgstr "以下说明假设："

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:33
#: 097fe9a6c6d6481f91169edbd5e62c5a
msgid "Your model is trimmed"
msgstr "您的模型已经过微调"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:34
#: 6095023c6b9845c5ba2469e14ac796f1
msgid "You have done your radio calibration"
msgstr "您已完成无线电校准"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:35
#: 032fc11f46c7406ea0d8f0dbaf0158cc
msgid "You have calibrated your airspeed sensor"
msgstr "您已校准空速传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:36
#: 7545bd383b7c40c1b8515bbbe64f19bb
msgid "You have leveled the autopilot"
msgstr "您已水平调整飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:37
#: 489bc6973129483dab23a01935ff6aa3
msgid ""
"You have set your autopilot and transmitter to be able to select :ref:`FBW-A"
" mode <fbwa-mode>`"
msgstr "您已设置飞控和遥控器以能够选择 :ref:`FBW-A 模式 <fbwa-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:38
#: b7f936f1c2584e85b853799fe67b3caf
msgid ""
"You have checked your pitch roll and yaw angle on the HUD and verified that "
"they match the rotation of the model"
msgstr "您已检查 HUD 上的俯仰、横滚和偏航角，并验证它们与模型的旋转方向一致"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:42
#: 5fd259c375a540ec89064e4d22d0d506
msgid "Ground Checks"
msgstr "地面检查"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:44
#: cbab1236c6804740a527d04a52780b7d
msgid "On the ground select FBW-A mode"
msgstr "在地面选择 FBW-A 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:45
#: 4fcd37707a744d8c8d1bde49f8c9069b
msgid ""
"Rotate your model nose up - you should see the elevators/elevons deflect "
"down"
msgstr "将飞机机头向上旋转——您应该看到升降舵/升降副翼向下偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:47
#: ad5b2c132c114333a882a6feb64d124d
msgid ""
"Rotate your model nose down - you should see the elevators/elevons deflect "
"up"
msgstr "将飞机机头向下旋转——您应该看到升降舵/升降副翼向上偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:49
#: 5d1f4513b19442ba86da783f81546a54
msgid ""
"Roll the model to the right - you should see the left aileron/elevon go up "
"and the right aileron/elevon go down."
msgstr "将模型向右倾斜——您应看到左副翼/升降副翼向上，右副翼/升降副翼向下偏转。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:51
#: 3de62c32cec841d1bc6a7eee7e1ff043
msgid ""
"Roll the model to the left - you should see the left aileron/elevon go down "
"and the right aileron/elevon go up."
msgstr "将模型向左倾斜——您应看到左副翼/升降副翼向下，右副翼/升降副翼向上偏转。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:53
#: 2ae5ba8fcfbc480c84671c68fe09cbd5
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Level the model - the control surfaces should be close to neutral. There "
"will be a little bit of displacement, but any more than 10% of your maximum "
"throw indicates that the autopilot has not been leveled or the radio "
"calibration needs to be repeated."
msgstr "将模型调平——控制面应接近中立位置。会有轻微偏移，但若超过最大行程的 10%，则表明飞控未水平调整或需要重新进行无线电校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:57
#: 49494c2c04104efba3c1483b6c74d929
msgid ""
"With the model level apply left and right roll stick inputs on your "
"transmitter - the controls should deflect in the same direction that they "
"would in manual mode."
msgstr "在模型水平的情况下，对遥控器施加左右横滚杆输入——控制面应向手动模式下相同的方向偏转。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:60
#: 2acc3820f6f4434fb84d9f48fcf7bb96
msgid ""
"With the model level apply up and down pitch stick inputs on your "
"transmitter the controls should deflect in the same direction that they "
"would in manual mode."
msgstr "在模型水平的情况下，对遥控器施加上下俯仰杆输入——控制面应向手动模式下相同的方向偏转。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:63
#: 36515437827b4df58402ab651373a019
msgid ""
"If you have an airspeed sensor enabled then blow air towards the front of "
"the pitot tube and watch the HUD. You should see the airspeed reading "
"increase"
msgstr "如果启用了空速传感器，向皮托管前端吹气并观察 HUD。您应该看到空速读数增加"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:68
#: c30e62ade3a549c7a04c03ac7cc0b878
msgid "Flight testing"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:70
#: ed2320a220e748d9878544e4f222f985
msgid ""
"Ideally you will need a second person to do this - one person to fly the "
"plane and one person to adjust the parameters. To follow the manual parts of"
" this procedure you need to be a proficient RC pilot or have someone who is "
"available to help you. Otherwise you will need to start at step 2 on the "
"Initial Assessment and be more cautious with control gain adjustment, "
"increasing them in small steps."
msgstr ""
"理想情况下需要两个人完成此操作——一人飞行，一人调整参数。要按照本程序的手动部分操作，您需要是熟练的 RC 飞手，或有人协助。否则需要从初始评估的第 2"
" 步开始，在调整控制增益时更加谨慎，分小步逐渐增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:78
#: 4ff8997400e6482c90f4ed648dfad688
msgid "Initial Assessment"
msgstr "初始评估"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:80
#: b30ae730e1b3400ca7313297ac85a684
msgid ""
"Take-off in manual and adjust the trims and throttle to a cruise position so"
" that the plane flies straight and level at a speed that you are comfortable"
" with. This will normally be somewhere between 30 and 60% throttle depending"
" on how overpowered your model is."
msgstr "在手动模式下起飞并调整微调和油门至巡航位置，使飞机以您满意的速度平直飞行。通常根据模型动力大小，油门在 30% 至 60% 之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:85
#: 8d167e7580d646b58cf02cc87f848799
msgid ""
"With the plane flying away from you switch to FBW-A. It should continue to "
"fly wings level and at a fairly constant height (it may climb or descend "
"slowly). If it wants to roll or pitch more than a small amount then there is"
" a problem with the model's trim, autopilot level or radio calibration and "
"you need to solve that first before proceeding further."
msgstr ""
"在飞机飞离您时切换至 "
"FBW-A。飞机应继续保持翼平飞行，高度基本稳定（可能缓慢爬升或下降）。若出现超过轻微横滚或俯仰，则模型微调、飞控水平调整或无线电校准存在问题，需先解决这些问题再继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:91
#: b88b1c057994406f9c147be0d0962ecc
msgid ""
"If the model starts to wag its wings, then the default ``RLL2SRV_P`` value "
"is too high for your model (this is unlikely but could happen) and you need "
"to switch back to manual immediately and ask your assistant to halve the "
"``RLL2SRV_P`` parameter before switching back into FBW-A"
msgstr ""
"若模型开始摇摆机翼，则默认 ``RLL2SRV_P`` 值对您的模型来说太高（这不太可能但可能发生），需立即切换回手动模式并请助手将 "
"``RLL2SRV_P`` 参数减半，然后再切换回 FBW-A"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:96
#: 9849bc7816b6472fac8ee03f19d40e2c
msgid ""
"If the model starts to porpoise, the default ``PTCH2SRV_P`` value is too "
"high (this is unlikely but could happen) and you need to switch back to "
"manual immediately and ask your assistant to halve the ``PTCH2SRV_P`` "
"parameter before switching back into FBW-A"
msgstr ""
"若模型开始海豚式振荡，则默认 ``PTCH2SRV_P`` 值太高（这不太可能但可能发生），需立即切换回手动模式并请助手将 ``PTCH2SRV_P``"
" 参数减半，然后再切换回 FBW-A"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:102
#: fc1b8e194ce34258a9e28f49fe880e14
msgid "Roll Control Tuning"
msgstr "横滚控制调参"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:105
#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:206
#: 9a3b312ebef14fd98759fbbd878b67aa ed2e425af3f14f468eefba13b0dba321
msgid "Method 1"
msgstr "方法 1"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:107
#: 9ff5747e9cfa452ca8431fbe67552a36
msgid ""
"This method is the simplest, but won't give the best result. For those users"
" familiar with tuning the old PID controllers, the ``RLL2SRV_P``, "
"``RLL2SRV_I`` and ``RLL2SRV_D`` gains have the same effect, but there are "
"some additional values that can be set by more advanced users."
msgstr ""
"此方法最简单，但效果不是最好。对于熟悉旧 PID 控制器调参的用户，``RLL2SRV_P``、``RLL2SRV_I`` 和 "
"``RLL2SRV_D`` 增益具有相同的效果，但高级用户还可以设置一些额外的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:113
#: d17e54cd7082447fa48fd643ba18c6ef
msgid ""
"With the model in FBW-A mode, put in a rapid bank angle demand by pushing "
"the aileron stick all the way over, hold it for a couple of seconds and then"
" release. Do the same in the other direction. You want the model to roll "
"quickly and smoothly to the new bank angle and back again without overshoot "
"or any wing 'rocking'. If the roll response is too slow, then progressively "
"increase ``RLL2SRV_P`` in increments of 0.1 until you are happy with the "
"response."
msgstr ""
"在 FBW-A "
"模式下，快速施加坡度角指令，将副翼杆推到底，保持几秒钟后松开。在另一方向重复相同操作。您希望模型快速平稳地滚转到新坡度角并返回，无超调或机翼「摇晃」。若横滚响应太慢，以"
" 0.1 为步长逐渐增大 ``RLL2SRV_P``，直到对响应满意为止。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:120
#: dc06b916f71f4430bc7d6d218e329e41
msgid ""
"If you get bank angle oscillation or overshoot, then you need to reduce "
"``RLL2SRV_P``. If at this point you still don't have sufficient response "
"then you need to follow Method 2."
msgstr "若出现坡度角振荡或超调，则需减小 ``RLL2SRV_P``。若此时仍无足够响应，则需采用方法 2。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:123
#: c4354a0550894497b68a4c6635903c7f
msgid ""
"Once you are happy with the roll response you should now slowly increase the"
" ``RLL2SRV_I`` to give the controller some \"I gain\" to allow it to cope "
"better with wind. A value of 0.05 will work for most models. If you see "
"overshoot or oscillation when raising the I value then halve it."
msgstr ""
"对横滚响应满意后，应缓慢增大 ``RLL2SRV_I`` 以给控制器一些「I 增益」，使其更好地应对风扰。大多数模型 0.05 的值都适用。若提高 I "
"值时出现超调或振荡，则将其减半。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:130
#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:240
#: 604a2d0795cc40fe955ae3167378f463 ca073de7998b4fd5a5d73052fff37ed0
msgid "Method 2"
msgstr "方法 2"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:132
#: 56a63d4ce4a1453da04dcd6790eb0759
msgid ""
"This method will give a better result, but requires more caution because "
"step 2 can produce a high frequency instability that can overheat the "
"aileron servo(s) if allowed to continue."
msgstr "此方法效果更好，但需要更加谨慎，因为第 2 步可能产生高频不稳定性，若持续下去可能使副翼舵机过热。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:136
#: c39b697b8fa14fd6a97fd9d64d13d312
msgid ""
"With the model in FBW-A mode, put in a rapid bank angle demand, hold it and "
"release. Do the same in the other direction. You want the model to roll "
"quickly and smoothly to the new bank angle and back again without overshoot "
"or any wing 'waggle'. If the roll response is too slow, then progressively "
"increase the ``RLL2SRV_P`` gain in increments of 0.1 until you are happy "
"with the response or you start to get oscillation in bank angle or overshoot"
msgstr ""
"在 FBW-A "
"模式下，快速施加坡度角指令，保持后松开。在另一方向重复。您希望模型快速平稳地滚转到新坡度角并返回，无超调或机翼「摆动」。若横滚响应太慢，以 0.1 "
"为步长逐渐增大 ``RLL2SRV_P`` 增益，直到满意或出现坡度角振荡/超调为止"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:143
#: 063dfc543b1a4e4495b5f692991764e7
msgid ""
"Increase ``RLL2SRV_D`` in increments of 0.01 until it it starts to "
"oscillate, then halve it. Do not go above 0.1 for ``RLL2SRV_D`` without "
"checking the temperature of your servos when you land as in extreme cases "
"turning up this gain can cause rapid servo movement and overheat the servos "
"leading to premature failure."
msgstr ""
"以 0.01 为步长增大 ``RLL2SRV_D``，直到开始振荡后将其减半。``RLL2SRV_D`` 不要超过 "
"0.1，否则在降落时请检查舵机温度，极端情况下提高此增益可能导致舵机快速运动过热，导致过早失效。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:148
#: d03e196be8314ffcaa4ed6a90dcced79
msgid ""
"Now start to increase the integrator gain ``RLL2SRV_I`` in steps of 0.05 "
"from its default value of zero until the bank angle starts to overshoot or "
"oscillate, then halve it."
msgstr "然后从默认值零开始，以 0.05 为步长增大积分增益 ``RLL2SRV_I``，直到坡度角开始超调或振荡后将其减半。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:153
#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:257
#: 0437aef3757c4ea9846e1cd669fdd1ae d6da51505d584bd6a4effaa23b737f90
msgid "Tuning tips"
msgstr "调参技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:155
#: d2ed7516b905403795f71819ddcc7ef5
msgid ""
"Select the tuning box on the bottom of the Mission Planners Flight Data "
"page. You should get a scrolling black window above the map. Double click in"
" the black window and you should get a list of parameters to plot. Change "
"the selection until you have the roll and nav_roll plotted. Nav_roll is the "
"demand and roll is the response. You can use this to look for overshoot and "
"other behaviour that isn't so obvious from the ground looking at the model."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner "
"飞行数据页底部选择调参框。您应在地图上方看到一个黑色滚动窗口。双击黑色窗口，应出现可绘制的参数列表。更改选择直到同时绘制 roll 和 "
"nav_roll。nav_roll 为指令值，roll 为响应值。可用此方法查看超调和其他从地面看模型时不明显的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:162
#: c50c54cdcd99438e91c17597e83a182d
msgid ""
"Check for any steady offset between nav_roll and roll. If you have followed "
"the basic method you may see an offset which can be removed by setting "
"``RLL2SRV_I`` to a small value (say 0.01) which will allow the control loop "
"to slowly trim the aileron demand to remove the steady error."
msgstr ""
"检查 nav_roll 和 roll 之间是否存在稳定偏差。若使用基本方法，可能会看到可通过将 ``RLL2SRV_I`` 设为小值（如 "
"0.01）来消除的偏差，这将允许控制环缓慢微调副翼指令以消除稳态误差。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:167
#: 626479bfd05b40049399e812747d81b6
msgid ""
"Although the autopilot will prevent the integrator from increasing if the "
"maximum aileron is exceeded, there is additional protection provided by the "
"``RLL2SRV_IMAX`` parameter. This parameter sets the maximum amount of "
"aileron (in centi-degrees) that the integrator can control. The default "
"value of 1500 allows the integrator to trim up to 1/3 of the total aileron "
"travel. This parameter should not need to be changed unless you are trying "
"to tune the controller to be able to compensate for large roll offsets due "
"to system failures."
msgstr ""
"尽管飞控会在达到最大副翼时阻止积分器继续增加，但 ``RLL2SRV_IMAX`` "
"参数提供了额外保护。此参数设置积分器可控制的最大副翼量（单位：厘度）。默认值 1500 允许积分器微调最多 1/3 "
"的总副翼行程。除非需要调参控制器以补偿系统故障导致的大横滚偏差，否则无需更改此参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:175
#: 669ecb15649a49fd83dfa95563780839
msgid ""
"The maximum roll rate can be constrained to make the model bank more "
"smoothly by setting the roll rate limit :ref:`RLL2SRV_RMAX<RLL2SRV_RMAX>` "
"parameter to a non-zero value. The default value of 60 deg/sec works well "
"for most models. Setting this parameter to 0 turns the rate limiter off and "
"can make the effect of tuning changes easier to see. If this value is "
"reduced too far, then the roll controller is unable to keep up with demands "
"from the navigation controller which leads to overshoot and weaving in the "
"aircraft's trajectory."
msgstr ""
"可通过将横滚速率限制 :ref:`RLL2SRV_RMAX<RLL2SRV_RMAX>` "
"参数设为非零值来约束最大横滚速率，使模型更平稳地坡度飞行。默认值 60 度/秒对大多数模型效果良好。将此参数设为 0 "
"可关闭速率限制器，使调参变化效果更易观察。若此值减小过多，横滚控制器将无法跟上导航控制器的指令，导致航迹超调和蛇行。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:183
#: 88c574beb5f54e80856f7c54da15041f
msgid ""
"The time constant parameter :ref:`RLL2SRV_TCONST<RLL2SRV_TCONST>` can also "
"be used to adjust how rapidly the bank angle reaches the demanded value. The"
" effect of this parameter will be seen mostly in the response to small step "
"changes in demanded roll. For larger roll demands, the roll rate limit "
":ref:`RLL2SRV_RMAX<RLL2SRV_RMAX>` tends to mask its effect. Making this "
"parameter smaller will cause the aircraft to reach its demanded roll angle "
"in less time, but only if the aircraft is capable. A very slow responding "
"airframe may require a slightly larger setting for this parameter."
msgstr ""
"时间常数参数 :ref:`RLL2SRV_TCONST<RLL2SRV_TCONST>` "
"也可用于调整坡度角达到指令值的速度。此参数的效果主要体现在对指令横滚的小阶跃变化响应上。对于较大的横滚指令，横滚速率限制 "
":ref:`RLL2SRV_RMAX<RLL2SRV_RMAX>` "
"往往会掩盖其效果。减小此参数将使飞机在更短时间内达到指令横滚角，但前提是飞机有能力实现。响应非常缓慢的机架可能需要稍大的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:192
#: 5edbfd29b9f848a3bc5a57c22b57cd2d
msgid ""
"Plot the roll_speed in the tuning window. This shows the rate of roll in "
"radians/second. A value of 1 radian/second is approximately equal to 60 "
"degrees/second (57 to be more precise), so if you have "
":ref:`RLL2SRV_RMAX<RLL2SRV_RMAX>` set to 60, the maximum roll_speed when "
"responding to a large bank angle demand (eg full bank one way to full bank "
"the other) should be just above 1.0. A value of greater than 1.1 indicates "
"that ``RLL2SRV_P`` is too high and should be reduced, whereas a value of "
"less than 1 indicates that ``RLL2SRV_P`` should be increased."
msgstr ""
"在调参窗口绘制 roll_speed。这显示的是以弧度/秒为单位的横滚速率。1 弧度/秒约等于 60 度/秒（精确值为 57），因此若 "
":ref:`RLL2SRV_RMAX<RLL2SRV_RMAX>` 设为 60，响应大坡度指令（如全横滚一侧到另一侧）时的最大 roll_speed "
"应略高于 1.0。值大于 1.1 表明 ``RLL2SRV_P`` 过高应减小，值小于 1 表明 ``RLL2SRV_P`` 应增大。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:203
#: 2d61da3050b2439f92f3775f5890668d
msgid "Pitch Control Tuning"
msgstr "俯仰控制调参"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:208
#: 24ca786c849a4e5593a455dc04cb8fb2
msgid ""
"This method is the simplest and but won't give the best result. For those "
"users familiar with tuning the old PID controller gains, the K_P, K_I and "
"K_D gains in this controller have the same effect, but there are some "
"additional values that can be set by more advanced users."
msgstr ""
"此方法最简单，但效果不是最好。对于熟悉旧 PID 控制器增益调参的用户，此控制器中的 K_P、K_I 和 K_D "
"增益具有相同的效果，但高级用户还可以设置一些额外的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:213
#: 77185f4606b245aa977eaa94ec1f1e48
msgid ""
"With the model in FBW-A mode, put in a rapid pitch angle demand, hold it and"
" release. Do the same in the other direction. You want the model to pitch "
"quickly and smoothly to the new pitch angle and back again without overshoot"
" or any porpoising. If the pitch response is too slow, then progressively "
"increase ``PTCH2SRV_P`` in increments of 0.1 until you are happy with the "
"response."
msgstr ""
"在 FBW-A 模式下，快速施加俯仰角指令，保持后松开。在另一方向重复。您希望模型快速平稳地俯仰到新角度并返回，无超调或海豚式振荡。若俯仰响应太慢，以 "
"0.1 为步长逐渐增大 ``PTCH2SRV_P``，直到对响应满意为止。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:219
#: aefff38ad58e4ecc86a16ac55d3220d6
msgid ""
"If you get pitch angle oscillation or overshoot, then you need to reduce "
"``PTCH2SRV_P``. If at this point you still don't have sufficient response "
"then you need to check your radio calibration, the minimum and maximum pitch"
" angles and potentially follow Method 2."
msgstr ""
"若出现俯仰角振荡或超调，则需减小 ``PTCH2SRV_P``。若此时仍无足够响应，则需检查无线电校准、最小和最大俯仰角，并可能需要采用方法 2。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:223
#: 88d8d8f3d5624cb6a44494a6c9c118ea
msgid ""
"Now roll the model to maximum bank in each direction. The nose should stay "
"fairly level during the turns without significant gain or loss of altitude. "
"Some loss of altitude during sustained turns at constant throttle is "
"expected, because the extra drag of turning slows the model down which will "
"cause a mild descent. If the model gains height during the turns then you "
"need to reduce the :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>` by small increments of "
"0.05 from the default value of 1.0. If the model descends immediately when "
"the model banks (a mild descent later in the turn when the model slows down "
"is normal as explained earlier) then increase the "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>` by small increments of 0.01 from the "
"default value of 1.0. If you need to change the "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>` parameter outside the range from 0.7 to "
"1.4 then something is likely wrong with either the earlier tuning of your "
"pitch loop, your airspeed calibration or your autopilot's bank angle "
"estimate."
msgstr ""
"现在将模型向两个方向滚转至最大坡度。在转弯过程中机头应保持基本水平，不应有明显的高度增益或损失。在恒定油门持续转弯时出现轻微高度损失是预期的，因为转弯的额外阻力会使模型减速从而轻微下降。若模型在转弯时高度增加，则需以"
" 0.05 为步长从默认值 1.0 减小 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>`。若模型在坡度时立即下降（后来模型减速时出现轻微下降是正常的，如前所述），则以 "
"0.01 为步长从默认值 1.0 增大 :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>`。若需要将 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>` 调整到 0.7 到 1.4 "
"范围之外，则可能存在其他问题，应检查俯仰环的早期调参、空速校准或飞控的坡度角估计。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:242
#: 0052fb8a87944c228ecdad83208d0e61
msgid ""
"This method can give a better result, but requires more caution because step"
" 2) can produce a high frequency instability that unless reversion back to "
"manual is done quickly, could overstress the plane."
msgstr "此方法可以获得更好的结果，但需要更加谨慎，因为第 2）步可能产生高频不稳定性，若不迅速恢复手动模式，可能对飞机造成过大应力。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:246
#: e9b71c5a17f844dba4ad36ab3e5e0d5a
msgid "Perform the tuning steps from Method 1"
msgstr "执行方法 1 的调参步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:247
#: 4659f9dc878942c4a3390871c0dd9ec4
msgid ""
"Increase ``PTCH2SRV_D`` in increments of 0.01 until it it starts to "
"oscillate, then halve it. Do not go above 0.1 for ``PTCH2SRV_D`` without "
"checking the temperature of your servos when you land as in extreme cases "
"turning up this gain can cause rapid servo movement and overheat the servos "
"leading to premature failure."
msgstr ""
"以 0.01 为步长增大 ``PTCH2SRV_D``，直到开始振荡后将其减半。``PTCH2SRV_D`` 不要超过 "
"0.1，否则在降落时请检查舵机温度，极端情况下提高此增益可能导致舵机快速运动过热，导致过早失效。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:252
#: 595b4b7977b74374b4f2e6959c1a3227
msgid ""
"Now start to increase the integrator gain ``PTCH2SRV_I`` in steps of 0.05 "
"from its default value of zero until the pitch angle starts to overshoot or "
"oscillate, then halve it."
msgstr "然后从默认值零开始，以 0.05 为步长增大积分增益 ``PTCH2SRV_I``，直到俯仰角开始超调或振荡后将其减半。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:259
#: ffed12c9d09641008b01b8fda280f6de
msgid ""
"Select the tuning box on the bottom of the Mission Planners Flight Data "
"page. You should get a scrolling black window above the map. Double click in"
" the black window and you should get a list of parameters to plot. Change "
"the selection until you have the pitch and nav_pitch plotted. Nav_pitch is "
"the demand and pitch is the response. You can use this to look for overshoot"
" and other behaviour that isn't so obvious from the ground looking at the "
"model."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner "
"飞行数据页面底部选择调参框。您应该在地图上方看到一个滚动的黑色窗口。在黑色窗口中双击，应该看到要绘制的参数列表。更改选择，直到显示 pitch 和 "
"nav_pitch 的图表。Nav_pitch 是期望值，pitch 是响应值。您可以用此查找过冲和其他从地面看飞机不那么明显的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:266
#: d76fd05efb91430e85f35fbff2b25ebe
msgid ""
"Check for any steady offset between nav_pitch-roll and pitch. If you have "
"followed the basic method you may see an offset which can be removed by "
"setting ``PTCH2SRV_I`` to a small value (say 0.05) which will allow the "
"control loop to slowly trim the elevator demand to remove the steady error. "
"The value of ``PTCH2SRV_I`` can be increased in small increments of 0.05 "
"until you are satisfied with the speed at which the control loop 're-trims'."
msgstr ""
"检查 nav_pitch-roll 和 pitch 之间是否存在稳定偏差。若使用基本方法，可能会看到可通过将 ``PTCH2SRV_I`` 设为小值（如"
" 0.05）来消除的偏差，这将允许控制环缓慢微调升降舵指令以消除稳态误差。``PTCH2SRV_I`` 的值可以以 0.05 "
"为步长增大，直到对控制环「重新微调」的速度满意为止。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:273
#: 2b93f5343b024bdb97535158a2d1a690
msgid ""
"Although the autopilot will prevent the integrator from increasing if the "
"maximum elevator is exceeded, there is additional protection provided by the"
" ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` parameter. This parameter sets the maximum amount of "
"elevator(in centi-degrees) that the integrator can control. The default "
"value of 1500 allows the integrator to trim up to 1/3 of the total elevator "
"travel. This should be enough to allow for the trim offset and variation in "
"trim with speed for most models."
msgstr ""
"尽管飞控会在达到最大升降舵时阻止积分器继续增加，但 ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` "
"参数提供了额外保护。此参数设置积分器可控制的最大升降舵量（单位：厘度）。默认值 1500 允许积分器微调最多 1/3 "
"的总升降舵行程。这对于大多数模型的微调偏差和速度变化引起的微调变化应该足够。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:280
#: 651d914fa6464df99782018b6072a7e5
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"WARNING : If ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` is set too high, then there is a danger that "
"in FBW-A, if the model has been leveled so that zero pitch is too nose-up to"
" glide at a safe speed, that the integrator will continue to keep increasing"
" the elevator to maintain the demanded pitch angle until the model stalls. "
"``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` should be set to a value that is big enough to allow from "
"trim changes, but small enough so that it cannot stall the plane. The "
"default for Plane is 2/3 of total throw, which could produce this problem. "
"Be sure that :ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` is setup to add "
"negative pitch at low throttle in stabilized modes."
msgstr ""
"警告：若 ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` 设置过高，则在 FBW-A "
"模式下，若模型水平调整使零俯仰角的机头角度太高无法以安全速度滑翔，则积分器可能持续增加升降舵以维持指令俯仰角直到模型失速。``PTCH2SRV_IMAX``"
" 应设置为足够大以允许微调变化，但足够小以不会导致飞机失速。Plane 的默认值为总行程的 2/3，可能产生此问题。请确保设置了 "
":ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` 以在稳定模式低油门时添加负俯仰。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:289
#: bfb91b310fb945d595351109ad2c7f67
msgid ""
"The rate of pitch (and therefore the reduce the number of g's) used to "
"correct pitch angle errors can be limited setting the pitch rate limit "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>` and "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP>` parameters to non-zero values. "
"Setting these values to 560 divided by the airspeed (in metres/second) gives"
" a limit equivalent to approximately +- 1g."
msgstr ""
"用于修正俯仰角误差的俯仰速率（因此减少 g 值）可以通过将俯仰速率限制 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>` 和 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP>` 参数设为非零值来限制。将这些值设为 560 "
"除以空速（米/秒）给出的限制大约等于 +/-1g。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:294
#: 2282913570f24c0487f5ad1e956f350c
msgid ""
"The time constant parameter :ref:`PTCH2SRV_TCONST<PTCH2SRV_TCONST>` can also"
" be used to adjust how rapidly the pitch angle reaches the demanded value. "
"The effect of this parameter will be seen mostly in the response to small "
"step changes in demanded pitch. For larger pitch demands, the pitch rate "
"limits :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>` and "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP>` tend to mask its effect. Making "
"this parameter smaller will cause the aircraft to reach its demanded pitch "
"angle in less time, but only if the aircraft is capable. A very slow "
"responding airframe may require a slightly larger setting for this "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
"时间常数参数 :ref:`PTCH2SRV_TCONST<PTCH2SRV_TCONST>` "
"也可用于调整俯仰角达到指令值的速度。此参数的效果主要体现在对指令俯仰的小阶跃变化响应上。对于较大的俯仰指令，俯仰速率限制 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>` 和 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP>` "
"往往会掩盖其效果。减小此参数将使飞机在更短时间内达到指令俯仰角，但前提是飞机有能力实现。响应非常缓慢的机架可能需要稍大的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:303
#: 9e326e2c20b5416db6dcd0b547ecd707
msgid ""
"Plot the pitch_speed in the tuning window. This shows the rate of pitch in "
"radians/second. A value of 1 radian/second is approximately equal to 60 "
"degrees/second (57 to be more precise), so if for example you had \\ "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>`/UP set to 30, the maximum "
"pitch_speed when responding to a large pitch angle demand (eg full pitch one"
" way to full pitch the other way) should be just above 0.5. A value of "
"greater than 0.6 would indicate that ``PTCH2SRV_P`` is too high and should "
"be reduced, whereas a value of less than 0.5 would indicate that "
"``RLL2SRV_P`` should be increased."
msgstr ""
"在调参窗口绘制 pitch_speed。这显示的是以弧度/秒为单位的俯仰速率。1 弧度/秒约等于 60 度/秒（精确值为 57），因此若例如 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>`/UP 设为 30，响应大俯仰角指令（如全俯仰一侧到另一侧）时的最大 "
"pitch_speed 应略高于 0.5。值大于 0.6 表明 ``PTCH2SRV_P`` 过高应减小，值小于 0.5 表明 "
"``RLL2SRV_P`` 应增大。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:315
#: adf0fc87f207406e9fc8e3fb4cdf781b
msgid "Yaw Controller Tuning"
msgstr "偏航控制器调参"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:317
#: 377d44ae7eba4d37b2c1287748e86150
msgid ""
"The yaw control loop can be configured either as a simple yaw damper (good "
"for models with inadequate fin area) or as a combined yaw damper and side-"
"slip controller. Because control of side-slip uses measured lateral "
"acceleration, it will only work for those models that have enough fuselage "
"side area to produce a measurable lateral acceleration when they side-slip "
"(an extreme example of this is an aerobatic model flying a knife-edge "
"maneuver where all of the lift is produced by the fuselage). Gliders with "
"slender fuselages and flying wings cannot use this feature, but can still "
"benefit from the yaw damper provided they have a yaw control (rudder, "
"differential airbrakes, etc)"
msgstr ""
"偏航控制环可以配置为简单的偏航阻尼器（适用于垂尾面积不足的飞机），或组合偏航阻尼器和侧滑控制器。由于侧滑控制使用测量的侧向加速度，它只适用于机身侧面面积足够大、侧滑时能产生可测量侧向加速度的飞机（极端例子是飞机以刀锋飞行时，所有升力由机身产生）。具有细长机身的滑翔机和飞翼无法使用此功能，但如果它们有偏航控制（方向舵、差动减速板等），仍可从偏航阻尼器中获益。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:329
#: 2582ecac09db45f59882c4b25122d038
msgid "Tuning the yaw damper"
msgstr "调参偏航阻尼器"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:331
#: 39321335af8f4c2da5ad749be902ac4d
msgid ""
"Verify that the :ref:`YAW2SRV_SLIP<YAW2SRV_SLIP>` and "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_INT<YAW2SRV_INT>` gain terms are set to zero, the "
"``YAW2SRV_RLL`` gain term is set to 1.0 and the "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_DAMP<YAW2SRV_DAMP>` gain term is set to zero"
msgstr ""
"验证 :ref:`YAW2SRV_SLIP<YAW2SRV_SLIP>` 和 :ref:`YAW2SRV_INT<YAW2SRV_INT>` "
"增益项设为零，``YAW2SRV_RLL`` 增益项设为 1.0，:ref:`YAW2SRV_DAMP<YAW2SRV_DAMP>` 增益项设为零"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:334
#: 949d8190656a47e49548f4ed1ccb749d
msgid ""
"Now rapidly roll the model from maximum bank angle in one direction to "
"maximum bank angle in the opposite direction. Do this several times going in"
" each direction and observe the yawing motion of the model. If as the wings "
"pass through level the nose is yawed in the opposite direction to the roll "
"(for example when rolling from left to right bank, the nose points left) "
"then increase the value of :ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` gain until the "
"yaw goes away. Do not use a value larger than 1."
msgstr ""
"现在快速将飞机从一侧最大坡度滚转到另一侧最大坡度。在每个方向重复多次，观察飞机的偏航运动。如果机翼过水平位置时机头向横滚的反方向偏航（例如从左横滚到右横滚时机头向左），则增大"
" :ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` 增益直到偏航消失。不要使用大于 1 的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:342
#: 58d68c1520a444ce9ad91af803ebcef9
msgid ""
"Increase :ref:`YAW2SRV_DAMP<YAW2SRV_DAMP>` in small increments of 0.05 until"
" the yaw angle starts to oscillate. When this happens, the tail will appear "
"to 'wag'. Halve the gain from the value that caused the oscillation."
msgstr ""
"以 0.05 为步长增大 "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_DAMP<YAW2SRV_DAMP>`，直到偏航角开始振荡。发生这种情况时，尾部会出现「摇摆」现象。将导致振荡的值减半作为最终值。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:345
#: b40ddd0df2f341e19d5c05d44a46cd4e
msgid ""
"Now roll the model into and out of turns in both directions. If the model "
"has a tendency to yaw the nose to the outside of the turn, then increase the"
" :ref:`YAW2SRV_RLL<YAW2SRV_RLL>` gain term in increments of 0.05 from its "
"default value of 1.0. Conversely if the model has a tendency to yaw the nose"
" to the inside of the turn on turn entry, then reduce the "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_RLL<YAW2SRV_RLL>` gain term in increments of 0.01 from its "
"default value of 1.0. If you have to go outside the range from 0.7 to 1.4, "
"then there is something else that needs to be sorted and you should check "
"that you have performed step 2) correctly and check your airspeed "
"calibration if airspeed is being used."
msgstr ""
"现在将飞机在两个方向上进出转弯。如果飞机有向转弯外侧偏航机头的趋势，以 0.05 为增量从其默认值 1.0 增大 "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_RLL<YAW2SRV_RLL>` 增益项。反之，如果飞机在进弯时有向转弯内侧偏航机头的趋势，以 0.01 为增量从其默认值"
" 1.0 减小 :ref:`YAW2SRV_RLL<YAW2SRV_RLL>` 增益项。如果需要将值调整到 0.7 至 1.4 "
"范围之外，则可能存在其他需要解决的问题，应检查步骤 2) 是否正确执行，并检查空速传感器校准（如使用空速）。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:357
#: bf972a9df33640029d376e95a1ad070c
msgid "Tuning the sideslip controller"
msgstr "调参侧滑控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:359
#: 0ae535d543cd480496655c16a8c8e1e4
msgid "Tune the yaw damper first"
msgstr "先调参偏航阻尼器"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:360
#: e6c0e4dd750d4694a4c754a48356914c
msgid ""
"Bring up the tuning graph window in the mission planner and plot the lateral"
" acceleration ay."
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中打开调参图表窗口，绘制侧向加速度 ay。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:362
#: 21c5dea541c64c4dba45e988c7137c90
msgid ""
"Roll the model rapidly from full bank in each direction and observe the "
"lateral acceleration ay. If the lateral acceleration sits around zero and "
"doesn't change when you roll into or out of turns then no side-slip control "
"is necessary. You can finish at this point."
msgstr "快速将飞机从每个方向的最大坡度滚转，观察侧向加速度 ay。如果侧向加速度保持在零附近，在进出转弯时不变化，则不需要侧滑控制。可以在此结束。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:366
#: cac3c22f11f7471fa2b59b0d06f06601
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`YAW2SRV_INT<YAW2SRV_INT>` gain term to 1.0. If this causes the"
" yaw angle to oscillate then halve the gain from the smallest value that "
"causes oscillation."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`YAW2SRV_INT<YAW2SRV_INT>` 增益项设为 1.0。如果这导致偏航角震荡，则从导致震荡的最小值减半增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/roll-pitch-controller-tuning.rst:369
#: 840cdf46f5874d26be5830f9a7f8c672
msgid ""
"If you see that the y acceleration is offset or spikes up during turns, then"
" progressively increase the :ref:`YAW2SRV_SLIP<YAW2SRV_SLIP>` gain in steps "
"of 0.5 until the error goes away or the yaw angle starts to oscillate. If "
"yaw oscillation occurs, then halve the gain from the value at which caused "
"the oscillation."
msgstr ""
"如果您看到 y 加速度有偏移或在转弯时出现峰值，则以 0.5 为步长逐步增大 :ref:`YAW2SRV_SLIP<YAW2SRV_SLIP>` "
"增益，直到误差消失或偏航角开始震荡。如果发生偏航震荡，则从导致震荡的值减半增益。"

